abstract: >-
  A friendly, polished Sudoku game for the browser with Classic, Daily, Zen,
  Challenge, pack and lesson modes. It runs offline, stores progress locally,
  and ships a pure TypeScript puzzle engine for generation, grading, hints and
  share codes. Made by ffrizzy.
